msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionText|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "question text"
msgstr "问题文本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The literal wording of a question, carrying its language tag and any RDF 1.2 base direction. Distinct from a naming label and from the answerhood condition that individuates the Question. Non-functional: several co-equal wordings or languages may describe the same question."
msgstr "问题的字面措辞，保留语言标签以及任何 RDF 1.2 基础方向。它不同于命名标签，也不同于确定 Question 身份的答案条件。非单值：同一问题可以有多种地位平等的措辞或语言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:keys gmeow:questionText 'Where are the keys?'@en ."
msgstr "ex:keys gmeow:questionText '钥匙在哪里？'@zh ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Every supplied wording must be a language-tagged literal; ordinary and directional language strings are both admitted. No wording is preferred, and a question need not have a recorded wording to exist."
msgstr "每个提供的措辞都必须是带语言标签的字面量；普通语言字符串和带方向的语言字符串都被接受。没有首选措辞，问题的存在也不要求已经记录措辞。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using a naming label as the sole content slot, treating wording equality as question identity, or replacing several wordings with a preferred one."
msgstr "避免将命名标签作为唯一的内容字段、将措辞相等视为问题身份相同，或用某个首选措辞替换多种措辞。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach each original wording with its language and direction intact. Use rdfs:label separately for a short name; retain attribution and scope on the wording assertion when they matter."
msgstr "附加每个原始措辞并完整保留其语言和方向。另用 rdfs:label 提供简短名称；需要时在措辞断言上保留归属和作用域。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a consumer records what an agent actually asks or holds open, independently of the name used to find that question."
msgstr "用于消费者记录代理实际提出或持续关注的未决问题，而不依赖用来查找该问题的名称。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageViolation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Question Text Language Violation"
msgstr "问题文本语言违规"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageViolation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The failure raised when a questionText value is not a literal with a language tag. The failure concerns the recorded wording, not whether the question has an answer or whether an agent remembers it."
msgstr "当 questionText 值不是带语言标签的字面量时产生的失败。该失败涉及记录的措辞，而不是问题是否有答案，或代理是否记得它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageViolation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An untagged questionText value causes its subject to be marked with QuestionTextLanguageViolation."
msgstr "不带语言标签的 questionText 值会使其主语被标记为 QuestionTextLanguageViolation。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageViolation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Plain strings, other typed literals and non-literal values fail; RDF 1.2 language strings with base direction remain valid."
msgstr "普通字符串、其他类型的字面量以及非字面量值都不通过；带基础方向的 RDF 1.2 语言字符串仍然有效。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageViolation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid asserting this marker merely because a question is unanswered or has several co-equal wordings."
msgstr "避免仅因问题尚无答案或具有多种地位平等的措辞而断言此标记。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageViolation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Inspect the original wording value and the violated law, then supply the language actually observed without guessing a language or dropping base direction."
msgstr "检查原始措辞值和被违反的定律，再提供实际观察到的语言；不得猜测语言或丢弃基础方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageViolation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify a wording record rejected by the native or projected language-presence law."
msgstr "用于识别被原生或投影语言标签存在性定律拒绝的措辞记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Question text language constraint"
msgstr "问题文本语言约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every value carried by questionText must satisfy the native language-tag presence relation. This law preserves ordinary and directional language strings without requiring one global wording."
msgstr "questionText 承载的每个值都必须满足原生语言标签存在关系。此定律保留普通和带方向的语言字符串，不要求全局唯一措辞。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A tagged English wording passes; the same untagged lexical value is rejected."
msgstr "带语言标签的英语措辞通过；相同但不带标签的词法值被拒绝。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The law applies to each supplied questionText value. It does not require a wording, identify questions by text or choose a preferred language."
msgstr "该定律适用于每个提供的 questionText 值。它不要求必须有措辞，不按文本确定问题身份，也不选择首选语言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing the language test with a string datatype check, which excludes language-tagged strings or admits untagged words."
msgstr "避免将语言测试替换为字符串数据类型检查，因为后者会排除带语言标签的字符串，或接受不带标签的文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Execute the canonical integrity formula or its generated validation projection and retain the offending subject, original value and law identity."
msgstr "执行规范完整性公式或其生成的验证投影，并保留违规主语、原始值和定律身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QuestionTextLanguageConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when validating consumer question records before exposing their wording as language-bearing content."
msgstr "用于在将问题措辞作为带语言的内容提供之前，验证消费者的问题记录。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureInquirerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tenureInquirer is functional"
msgstr "tenureInquirer 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureInquirerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureInquirer is functional: a gmeow:InquiryTenure records the open question of exactly one agent — two agents holding the same question open are two tenures sharing one gmeow:tenureQuestion, not two inquirers on one tenure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureInquirer 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InquiryTenure 恰好记录一个主体的悬而未决问题——两个主体共同悬置同一个问题时,是两个共享同一个 gmeow:tenureQuestion 的保有,而不是一个保有上的两个探询者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureQuestionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tenureQuestion is functional"
msgstr "tenureQuestion 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureQuestionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureQuestion is functional: a gmeow:InquiryTenure records exactly one held-open question — an agent holding five questions open bears five tenures, and sharing happens at a single gmeow:Question individual rather than by multi-valuing this edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureQuestion 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InquiryTenure 恰好记录一个被悬置的问题——一个主体同时悬置五个问题就拥有五个保有,共享发生在单一的 gmeow:Question 个体层面,而不是通过给这条边赋多个值来实现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureInquirerFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:tenureInquirer names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:tenureInquirer 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureInquirerFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureInquirerFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:tenureInquirer, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:tenureInquirer, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureInquirerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:tenureInquirerFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:tenureInquirer ."
msgstr "gmeow:tenureInquirerFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:tenureInquirer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureQuestionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:tenureQuestion names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:tenureQuestion 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureQuestionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureQuestionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:tenureQuestion, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:tenureQuestion, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureQuestionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:tenureQuestionFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:tenureQuestion ."
msgstr "gmeow:tenureQuestionFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:tenureQuestion ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureInquirerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:tenureInquirer and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:tenureInquirer (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:tenureInquirer 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:tenureInquirer 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureQuestionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:tenureQuestion and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:tenureQuestion (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:tenureQuestion 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:tenureQuestion 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/InquiryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Records how the inquiry is being run, not what would count as an answer. It is orthogonal to the erotetic question type, so the two co-apply: the same wh-question can be pursued as a scan or as a deep dive without changing what would answer it."
msgstr "它记录的是探究如何进行，而非什么才算作答复。它与问句的疑问类型彼此正交，二者可以并用：同一个特指问句既可以以浏览方式追索，也可以以深挖方式追索，而何为其答复并不因此改变。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/InquiryStatus|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Records the state of the PURSUIT and never the epistemic standing of an answer. Whether an answer is believed or known lives on the epistemics spine, so a settled inquiry may still carry an answer nobody believes."
msgstr "它记录的是追索本身的状态，绝不涉及答复的认知地位。答复是被相信还是被知晓，属于认知论主干，因此一项已了结的探究仍可能带着无人相信的答复。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inquiryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Classifies the question by the operational kind of the inquiry pursuing it, drawn from an OPEN value vocabulary. It is not the erotetic question type: the two axes co-apply, and using one where the other belongs makes an answerhood condition look like a work style."
msgstr "它按追索该问题的探究之操作类型来给问题分类，取值来自一个开放的值词汇表。它不是疑问类型：两条轴可以并用，若以此代彼，就会把成答条件说成工作方式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/InquiryKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Inquiry Kind"
msgstr "探究种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/InquiryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The OPERATIONAL kind of a research inquiry — a VALUE, never a gmeow:Question subclass. Held apart from gmeow:QuestionType, which is the CLOSED erotetic classification by answerhood condition (polar / alternative / wh / why / how): this axis records how the inquiry is being run rather than what would count as an answer, so a single wh question pursued as a research plan carries one value from each vocabulary rather than one conflated kind. The set is OPEN, unlike gmeow:QuestionType — a kind not among the seeded individuals is a fresh gmeow:InquiryKind individual carrying rdfs:label, not a new class."
msgstr "研究性探究的操作类型——它是一个取值，绝非 gmeow:Question 的子类。它与 gmeow:QuestionType 分立，后者是按成答条件划分的封闭疑问学分类（是非、选择、特指、因由、方式）：本轴记录的是探究如何进行，而非什么才算作答复，因此同一个特指问句若以研究计划方式追索，便会从两套词汇各取一值，而不是合成一个混杂的种类。与 gmeow:QuestionType 不同，本集合是开放的——若某个种类不在预置个体之列，那就新建一个带 rdfs:label 的 gmeow:InquiryKind 个体，而不是新建一个类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/InquiryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:whoOwnsLotSeven gmeow:inquiryKind gmeow:inquiryKindResearchPlan ."
msgstr "示例：ex:whoOwnsLotSeven gmeow:inquiryKind gmeow:inquiryKindResearchPlan 。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/InquiryStatus|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Inquiry Status"
msgstr "探究状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/InquiryStatus|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The working status of a research inquiry — a VALUE, never a gmeow:Question subclass. It records the state of the PURSUIT (not yet started, being worked, settled, dropped, parked), not the epistemic standing of any answer: whether an answer is believed or known stays on the epistemics spine (gmeow:accepts / gmeow:knowsThat) and is never inferred from a status value. The set is OPEN; a status not among the seeded individuals is a fresh gmeow:InquiryStatus individual, not a new class."
msgstr "研究性探究的工作状态——它是一个取值，绝非 gmeow:Question 的子类。它记录追索本身的状态（尚未开始、正在进行、已了结、已放弃、暂时搁置），而非任何答复的认知地位：答复是被相信还是被知晓，属于认知论主干（gmeow:accepts / gmeow:knowsThat），绝不可由状态值推得。本集合是开放的；若某状态不在预置个体之列，那就新建一个 gmeow:InquiryStatus 个体，而不是新建一个类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/InquiryStatus|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:whoOwnsLotSeven gmeow:inquiryStatus gmeow:inquiryStatusActive ."
msgstr "示例：ex:whoOwnsLotSeven gmeow:inquiryStatus gmeow:inquiryStatusActive 。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inquiryKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "inquiry kind"
msgstr "探究种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inquiryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Classifies a gmeow:Question by the OPERATIONAL kind of the inquiry pursuing it, drawn from the open gmeow:InquiryKind value vocabulary. NOT gmeow:questionType, which classifies the same question by its erotetic answerhood condition: the two axes are orthogonal and co-apply rather than compete. Non-functional — one question may be pursued as several kinds of inquiry at once, and competing standpoint-indexed kind claims coexist rather than contradict (Principle 9)."
msgstr "按追索某个 gmeow:Question 之探究的操作类型对该问题分类，取值来自开放的 gmeow:InquiryKind 值词汇表。它不是 gmeow:questionType，后者按疑问学上的成答条件对同一个问题分类：两条轴彼此正交，可以并用而非相互竞争。它不是函数性的——同一个问题可以同时以多种探究类型加以追索，而按不同立场索引的种类主张彼此并存，并不构成矛盾（原则九）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inquiryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:whoOwnsLotSeven gmeow:inquiryKind gmeow:inquiryKindResearchPlan ."
msgstr "示例：ex:whoOwnsLotSeven gmeow:inquiryKind gmeow:inquiryKindResearchPlan 。"

# Retained source context of a question.

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionContext|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "question context"
msgstr "问题情境"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionContext|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A question's source context, verbatim, with supplied language and direction. It is distinct from questionText and the answerhood condition that identifies the question."
msgstr "问题的原样来源情境，包括提供的语言和方向。它区别于 questionText 以及标识问题的回答条件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionContext|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the source's surrounding context of a Question."
msgstr "用于来源中围绕 Question 的情境。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionContext|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing questionText or asserting a presupposition from context wording."
msgstr "避免替代 questionText 或从情境措辞断言预设。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionContext|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the original context literal with its supplied language and base direction."
msgstr "保留原始情境字面量及其已有语言和基本方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionContext|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Several contexts may coexist; no context identifies the Question or establishes an accepted answer."
msgstr "多个情境可以并存；情境不标识 Question，也不建立已接受答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/questionContext|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:question gmeow:questionContext \"The question arose during the morning review.\"@en ."
msgstr "例如：ex:question gmeow:questionContext \"The question arose during the morning review.\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceReason|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Absence Reason"
msgstr "缺失原因"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Why a question has no answer — a value vocabulary (individuals, never subclasses) naming one reason an absence record gives: not found in the sources searched, retrieval failed, not published by its holder, or not applicable to the subject. A reason explains an absence and asserts nothing about the world: no reason entails a value or a negation. The set is open, and withholding by a disclosure policy is not one of them (that is gmeow:DisclosureOutcome)."
msgstr "问题为何没有答案——一个值词汇表（由个体构成，绝不使用子类），列出缺失记录可给出的原因：在所查来源中未找到、取得失败、持有者未公开，或不适用于该主体。原因只解释缺失，不对世界作任何断言：任何原因都不蕴含某个值或某种否定。该集合是开放的，披露策略造成的扣留不在其中（那是 gmeow:DisclosureOutcome）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:absenceReason gmeow:absenceReasonNotFound ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:absenceReason gmeow:absenceReasonNotFound ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using a reason to assert that a value is false or absent in the world, to record a deliberate withholding (use gmeow:DisclosureOutcome), or to mint per-reason subclasses; the reasons are individuals."
msgstr "避免用原因断言某个值在世界中为假或不存在，避免用它记录有意的扣留（应使用 gmeow:DisclosureOutcome），也避免为每个原因创建子类；各原因都是个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one of the seeded individuals through gmeow:absenceReason on a gmeow:AbsenceRecord; mint a new individual with a label and a definition that distinguishes it from the seeded ones only when none of them fits."
msgstr "在 gmeow:AbsenceRecord 上通过 gmeow:absenceReason 引用预置个体之一；只有当预置个体都不适用时，才创建带标签、且定义能与预置个体区分的新个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use as the value vocabulary behind gmeow:absenceReason, so the reason a question went unanswered is data a consumer can list and filter."
msgstr "用作 gmeow:absenceReason 的值词汇表，使问题未获回答的原因成为使用方可以列出和过滤的数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecord|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Absence Record"
msgstr "缺失记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed, dated observation that a question has no answer, with the reason. It names the subject and the property or question concerned, the vantage that determined the absence (gmeow:vantage) and when (gmeow:observedAt), and gives a reason (gmeow:absenceReason). It asserts no value and no negation, and nothing may be derived from it as false: an unanswered question is unknown, never false. A later answer does not contradict an earlier record; both are retained, each with its own time. It is a claim like any other, so records from different vantages coexist."
msgstr "一条有归属、有时间的观察，表明某个问题没有答案并给出原因。它指明主体以及所涉及的属性或问题、确定该缺失的视角（gmeow:vantage）和时间（gmeow:observedAt），并给出原因（gmeow:absenceReason）。它不断言任何值或否定，也不得由它推出任何为假的结论：未获回答的问题是未知的，而不是假的。后来的答案并不与先前的记录矛盾；两者都被保留，各自带有自己的时间。它与其他声明一样是一种声明，因此来自不同视角的记录并存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record a gmeow:AbsenceRecord ; gmeow:vantage ex:researcher ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:acme ; gmeow:absenceQuestion ex:whenFounded ; gmeow:absenceReason gmeow:absenceReasonNotFound ."
msgstr "ex:record a gmeow:AbsenceRecord ; gmeow:vantage ex:researcher ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:acme ; gmeow:absenceQuestion ex:whenFounded ; gmeow:absenceReason gmeow:absenceReasonNotFound ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid asserting it as a fact about the subject, reading it as a negative (an absent value is unknown, never false), deleting it when an answer arrives, or using it for a deliberate withholding by a disclosure policy (that is gmeow:DisclosureOutcome)."
msgstr "避免把它当作关于主体的事实来断言，避免把它读作否定（缺失的值是未知的，而不是假的），避免在答案出现时删除它，也避免用它表示披露策略造成的有意扣留（那是 gmeow:DisclosureOutcome）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Mint one record per determination: bind gmeow:vantage to who determined it, gmeow:observedAt to when, gmeow:observedFeature to the subject, gmeow:absenceQuestion or gmeow:absentProperty to what was asked, and gmeow:absenceReason to why; add gmeow:consultedSource for a not-found or retrieval-failed reason. Keep a later answer beside it."
msgstr "每次确定创建一条记录：用 gmeow:vantage 绑定确定者，用 gmeow:observedAt 绑定时间，用 gmeow:observedFeature 绑定主体，用 gmeow:absenceQuestion 或 gmeow:absentProperty 绑定所问内容，用 gmeow:absenceReason 绑定原因；对于未找到或取得失败的原因，再加上 gmeow:consultedSource。后来的答案保留在它旁边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record, as attributed and dated data, that a question about a subject went unanswered and why, without asserting any value or negation."
msgstr "用于以有归属、有时间的数据记录某个关于主体的问题未获回答及其原因，而不断言任何值或否定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceQuestion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "absence question"
msgstr "缺失问题"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceQuestion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The question an absence record says has no answer. Use it when the unanswered matter is a question; when it is a property of the subject, gmeow:absentProperty names that property. Non-functional: one determination may cover several questions."
msgstr "缺失记录所说没有答案的问题。未获回答的事项是一个问题时使用它；若是主体的某个属性，则由 gmeow:absentProperty 指明该属性。非函数性：一次确定可以涵盖多个问题。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceQuestion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:absenceQuestion ex:whenFounded ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:absenceQuestion ex:whenFounded ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceQuestion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating it as the question being answered or resolved; it only names what was found to be unanswered."
msgstr "避免把它当作正被回答或已解决的问题；它只指明被发现未获回答的内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceQuestion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Point the gmeow:AbsenceRecord at the gmeow:Question it concerns; a later answer is a separate gmeow:answers claim and the record stays."
msgstr "让 gmeow:AbsenceRecord 指向它所涉及的 gmeow:Question；后来的答案是单独的 gmeow:answers 声明，记录仍然保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceQuestion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to say which question an absence record concerns."
msgstr "用于说明缺失记录涉及哪个问题。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReason|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "absence reason"
msgstr "缺失原因"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reason an absence record gives for the missing answer, drawn from the open gmeow:AbsenceReason vocabulary. Non-functional: a different determination is a different record, and two records from different vantages may give different reasons for the same question; none is privileged (Principle 9)."
msgstr "缺失记录对答案缺失给出的原因，取自开放的 gmeow:AbsenceReason 词汇表。非函数性：不同的确定是不同的记录，来自不同视角的两条记录可能对同一问题给出不同原因；没有哪一个享有特权（原则 9）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:absenceReason gmeow:absenceReasonRetrievalFailed ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:absenceReason gmeow:absenceReasonRetrievalFailed ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reading any reason as a value or a negation, and avoid putting two reasons on one record to merge two determinations; mint a second record."
msgstr "避免把任何原因读作值或否定，也避免在一条记录上放两个原因来合并两次确定；应创建第二条记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Set exactly one gmeow:AbsenceReason on each gmeow:AbsenceRecord."
msgstr "在每条 gmeow:AbsenceRecord 上恰好设置一个 gmeow:AbsenceReason。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReason|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to say why a question has no answer."
msgstr "用于说明问题为何没有答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absentProperty|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "absent property"
msgstr "缺失属性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absentProperty|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The property of the subject for which an absence record found no value, given as the property itself. The record asserts nothing about the property: no value, no negation and no claim that the subject lacks it. The subject is the record's gmeow:observedFeature. Non-functional."
msgstr "缺失记录未找到值的主体属性，以属性本身给出。记录对该属性不作任何断言：没有值，没有否定，也不主张主体缺少它。主体是记录的 gmeow:observedFeature。非函数性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absentProperty|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:absentProperty gmeow:foundedOn ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:absentProperty gmeow:foundedOn ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absentProperty|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reading it as the subject lacking the property; an unanswered property is unknown, never false."
msgstr "避免把它读作主体缺少该属性；未获回答的属性是未知的，而不是假的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absentProperty|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Name the property that was asked about on the gmeow:AbsenceRecord, beside the subject given by gmeow:observedFeature."
msgstr "在 gmeow:AbsenceRecord 上指明所问的属性，与由 gmeow:observedFeature 给出的主体并列。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absentProperty|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the unanswered matter is a property of a subject rather than a worded question."
msgstr "当未获回答的事项是主体的某个属性而不是一个措辞明确的问题时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/consultedSource|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "consulted source"
msgstr "查阅来源"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/consultedSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source, collection, index or described scope consulted when an absence was determined. For a not-found reason it is the scope that was searched; for a retrieval-failed reason it is the source that could not be fetched. Non-functional: several sources may have been searched."
msgstr "确定缺失时所查阅的来源、集合、索引或被描述的范围。对于未找到的原因，它是被搜索的范围；对于取得失败的原因，它是无法取得的来源。非函数性：可能搜索过多个来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/consultedSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:consultedSource ex:parishRegisters ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:consultedSource ex:parishRegisters ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/consultedSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reading the sources as exhaustive: a not-found record says the answer was not found in them, not that it exists nowhere."
msgstr "避免把这些来源读作详尽无遗：未找到记录说的是答案在其中未被找到，而不是答案在任何地方都不存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/consultedSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Point the gmeow:AbsenceRecord at each source or scope searched; for a failed retrieval point at the one attempted source."
msgstr "让 gmeow:AbsenceRecord 指向每个被搜索的来源或范围；对于取得失败，则指向所尝试的那个来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/consultedSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to say where an absence was determined: the scope searched, or the source that could not be fetched."
msgstr "用于说明缺失是在何处确定的：被搜索的范围，或无法取得的来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReasonNotFound|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "not found"
msgstr "未找到"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReasonNotFound|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The sources searched were read and hold no answer. The record carries the scope searched through gmeow:consultedSource. It says nothing about sources outside that scope and nothing about whether an answer exists."
msgstr "所搜索的来源已被读取，其中没有答案。记录通过 gmeow:consultedSource 携带被搜索的范围。它对该范围之外的来源不作任何说明，也不说明答案是否存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReasonNotApplicable|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "not applicable"
msgstr "不适用"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReasonNotApplicable|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The question does not apply to this subject, so it has no answer by its nature (a dissolution date for an organisation that is still active). Unlike the other reasons this is a claim about the subject, made from a vantage, and it can be disputed by another vantage like any claim."
msgstr "该问题不适用于此主体，因此其性质决定了它没有答案（例如仍在运营的组织的解散日期）。与其他原因不同，这是关于主体的一项声明，由某个视角作出，并且像任何声明一样可被其他视角质疑。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReasonNotPublished|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "not published"
msgstr "未公开"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReasonNotPublished|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The answer exists but its holder has not made it public, so no public source states it. This is not a disclosure outcome: nothing was withheld by applying a policy to a reader, the holder simply has not published it."
msgstr "答案存在，但其持有者没有公开，因此没有任何公开来源陈述它。这不是披露结果：并没有通过对读者应用策略而扣留任何内容，只是持有者没有发布它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReasonRetrievalFailed|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "retrieval failed"
msgstr "取得失败"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/absenceReasonRetrievalFailed|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source could not be fetched, so it was not read and its content is unknown. The record points at the attempted source through gmeow:consultedSource. A failed retrieval produces no source snapshot and says nothing about what the source holds."
msgstr "无法取得该来源，因此它未被读取，其内容未知。记录通过 gmeow:consultedSource 指向所尝试的来源。取得失败不会产生来源快照，也不说明该来源包含什么。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecordReasonConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Absence record reason constraint"
msgstr "缺失记录原因约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecordReasonConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a direct gmeow:AbsenceRecord gives at least one gmeow:absenceReason."
msgstr "一条封闭世界完整性约束：直接的 gmeow:AbsenceRecord 至少给出一个 gmeow:absenceReason。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecordVantageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Absence record vantage constraint"
msgstr "缺失记录视角约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecordVantageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a direct gmeow:AbsenceRecord names at least one gmeow:vantage, the one who determined the absence; an absence is never a bare fact."
msgstr "一条封闭世界完整性约束：直接的 gmeow:AbsenceRecord 至少指明一个 gmeow:vantage，即确定该缺失的一方；缺失从来不是赤裸的事实。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecordTimeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Absence record time constraint"
msgstr "缺失记录时间约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRecordTimeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a direct gmeow:AbsenceRecord carries the instant it was determined (gmeow:observedAt), so a later answer can sit beside it with its own time."
msgstr "一条封闭世界完整性约束：直接的 gmeow:AbsenceRecord 携带其被确定的时刻（gmeow:observedAt），使后来的答案可以带着自己的时间与之并列。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceNotFoundScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Absence not-found scope constraint"
msgstr "未找到范围约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceNotFoundScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: an absence record whose reason is gmeow:absenceReasonNotFound names the scope that was searched through gmeow:consultedSource."
msgstr "一条封闭世界完整性约束：原因为 gmeow:absenceReasonNotFound 的缺失记录通过 gmeow:consultedSource 指明被搜索的范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRetrievalFailedSourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Absence retrieval-failed source constraint"
msgstr "取得失败来源约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AbsenceRetrievalFailedSourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: an absence record whose reason is gmeow:absenceReasonRetrievalFailed names the attempted source through gmeow:consultedSource."
msgstr "一条封闭世界完整性约束：原因为 gmeow:absenceReasonRetrievalFailed 的缺失记录通过 gmeow:consultedSource 指明所尝试的来源。"
